  message: "Shipped in PR #3236 (merged to dev as d88c10e64). New hypergumbo_core.rust_analyzer_install module with is_rust_analyzer_available / install_rust_analyzer / uninstall_rust_analyzer, plus hypergumbo install-rust-analyzer + uninstall-rust-analyzer CLI subcommands (both registered in the 'extras' group; --check flag matches gitleaks/embeddings behaviour). Rustup-only first cut; static-binary-download fallback tracked as a follow-up in the module docstring. 24 tests, 100% per-package coverage. Unblocks WI-huham (install-extras umbrella) and feeds the is_rust_analyzer_available helper consumed by WI-duzul Slice C + WI-nohah graceful-degrade."  # e3fa
